=========================================================================
  Third-Party Reference Code and Datasets
=========================================================================

The following third-party source code files and datasets are used solely
as REFERENCE DATA for algorithm validation and forensic analysis
benchmarking. They are NOT part of the Diffinite software itself and
retain their original licenses as noted below.

Current tree: these files are NOT tracked. They are fetched on demand
into example/ by example/download_examples.py (the IR-Plag and SOCO 2014
validation corpora are verified by SHA-256; the benchmark files are fetched
from the fixed upstream commits named below but not hash-checked) and are
excluded from the repository by .gitignore and from the Python package
and VS Code extension builds.

Git history: earlier revisions (roughly v0.3 through v0.12.x) did commit
copies of some of these files under example/ and TDD/corpus/. Those
copies remain in the repository history under the licenses listed below.
The TDD/corpus/ paths named below refer to that historical layout.

